<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-298] Paragraph progress bar and % complete not working</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-298</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I really like Zeppelin and it&apos;s capabilities. Please keep up the good work.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I am using the latest Zeppelin from master and I am running long Spark SQL queries in individual paragraphs. The queries complete fine but I don&apos;t see any indication of progress and the % complete remains the same (at 0%) until the query completes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I compiled Zeppelin like this:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;mvn clean package -DskipTests -P build-distr&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;And I am using an external Spark distribution - Spark 1.4.0 by setting SPARK_HOME&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
